The '''Dragon Queen''', sometimes called '''Dragon Empress''', is the ruler of all dragons following the death of [[Jythar]].

== Story ==
After the death of [[Jythar]] during the [[Calamity|{{DarkRed|Calamity}}]], all summoned dragons worship the Dragon Queen, or Dragon Empress (translation unclear according to {{NPCSprite|Corm}}). The [[Ender_Dragon#Variants|Superior Dragons]] are said to be the her direct spawns. It is possible that her and [[Jythar]] had a romantic connection.

